{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Available Types"}], "prev": {"link": "../PaidReactionTypeRegular/", "title": "PaidReactionTypeRegular"}, "next": {"link": "../CanPostStoryResultOk/", "title": "CanPostStoryResultOk"}, "title": "CanPostStoryResult", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"canpoststoryresult\">\n<h1>CanPostStoryResult<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#canpoststoryresult\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.types.CanPostStoryResult\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.types.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">CanPostStoryResult</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.types.CanPostStoryResult\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>This object represents result of checking whether the current user can post a story on behalf of the specific chat.</p>\n<p>Currently, it can be one of:</p>\n<ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../CanPostStoryResultOk/#pyrogram.types.CanPostStoryResultOk\" title=\"pyrogram.types.CanPostStoryResultOk\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">CanPostStoryResultOk</span></code></a></p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../CanPostStoryResultPremiumNeeded/#pyrogram.types.CanPostStoryResultPremiumNeeded\" title=\"pyrogram.types.CanPostStoryResultPremiumNeeded\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">CanPostStoryResultPremiumNeeded</span></code></a></p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../CanPostStoryResultBoostNeeded/#pyrogram.types.CanPostStoryResultBoostNeeded\" title=\"pyrogram.types.CanPostStoryResultBoostNeeded\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">CanPostStoryResultBoostNeeded</span></code></a></p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../CanPostStoryResultActiveStoryLimitExceeded/#pyrogram.types.CanPostStoryResultActiveStoryLimitExceeded\" title=\"pyrogram.types.CanPostStoryResultActiveStoryLimitExceeded\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">CanPostStoryResultActiveStoryLimitExceeded</span></code></a></p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../CanPostStoryResultWeeklyLimitExceeded/#pyrogram.types.CanPostStoryResultWeeklyLimitExceeded\" title=\"pyrogram.types.CanPostStoryResultWeeklyLimitExceeded\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">CanPostStoryResultWeeklyLimitExceeded</span></code></a></p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../CanPostStoryResultMonthlyLimitExceeded/#pyrogram.types.CanPostStoryResultMonthlyLimitExceeded\" title=\"pyrogram.types.CanPostStoryResultMonthlyLimitExceeded\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">CanPostStoryResultMonthlyLimitExceeded</span></code></a></p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["api/types/CanPostStoryResultOk", "CanPostStoryResultOk", "N", "next"], ["api/types/PaidReactionTypeRegular", "PaidReactionTypeRegular", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">CanPostStoryResult</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#pyrogram.types.CanPostStoryResult\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">CanPostStoryResult</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": true, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "api/types/CanPostStoryResult", "sidebars": ["sidebar/brand.html", "sidebar/search.html", "s